Third-Party Dependencies
========================

This project uses the following open-source libraries:

Noir Backend (noir-backend):
  - @noble/curves        (MIT)        — Elliptic curve cryptography
  - @noble/post-quantum  (MIT)        — Post-quantum cryptography primitives
  - bcryptjs             (MIT)        — Password hashing
  - better-sqlite3       (MIT)        — SQLite3 bindings
  - cors                 (MIT)        — Cross-Origin Resource Sharing
  - express              (MIT)        — Web framework
  - helmet               (MIT)        — Security headers
  - jsonwebtoken         (MIT)        — JWT authentication
  - lowdb                (MIT)        — JSON database
  - mongoose             (MIT)        — MongoDB ODM
  - node-addon-api       (MIT)        — Native addon API
  - sm-crypto            (MIT)        — Chinese national cryptographic algorithms (SM2/SM3/SM4)
  - uuid                 (MIT)        — UUID generation
  - ws                   (MIT)        — WebSocket

FIBEMATE ZK-SNARKs Server (fibemate-zk-server):
  - @noble/hashes        (MIT)        — Hash functions
  - @noble/post-quantum  (MIT)        — PQC primitives
  - snarkjs              (GPL-3.0)    — Zero-knowledge proof system

FIBEMATE Mixnet (fibemate-mixnet):
  - minimist             (MIT)        — CLI argument parser

TSA Timestamp Verification
==========================

This project uses Trusted Timestamp Authority (TSA) services for code integrity
verification and non-repudiation:

  - 联合信任时间戳服务中心 (tsa.cn)
  - DigiCert Timestamp Service

Timestamp certificates and verification instructions are available alongside
the relevant source files.

